  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-groundwater-level-prediction:\n\n- Predicts future groundwater levels using historical time series plus driving factors (precipitation, abstraction) via regression or random forest.\n- Decomposes time series into trend, seasonal, and residual components.\n- Performs spatial interpolation (IDW) to produce regional prediction rasters.\n- Quantifies uncertainty with RMSE and correlation coefficient using temporal hold-out.\n- Supports both real multi-temporal GeoTIFF inputs and fully synthetic, offline test data.\n- All processing operates locally; no user data is uploaded.",
